Revision history for App-csvtool

0.05    2026-11-20
        [CHANGES]
         * Added `sum` command
         * Added expression language tools `filter` and `extend`
         * Use core's `Time::Piece` rather than pulling in both
           `POSIX::strptime` and `Time::timegm` from CPAN

0.04    2024-12-03
        [CHANGES]
         * Ensure the `--tab` option actually works
         * Added `smudge total` filter
         * Added `count` command

0.03    2024-08-21
        [CHANGES]
         * Added `smudge` command, for smoothing out data observed over a
           range of time

0.02    2024-03-19
        [CHANGES]
         * Added a selection of timestamp-related commands: tsort, strftime,
           strptime
         * Added `join` command
         * Accept field index 'u' to cut subcommand to generate extra empty
           fields

0.01    2023-12-11
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.


